 "description": "Read the current VolunteerReminder account: organization name, plan and entitlements, current reminder send mode, and volunteer usage vs the plan limit. Call this first to understand what the account can do before creating schedules or contacts. Note the `reminder_mode`: an account created through this connector (create_account) starts in `test` (reminders reroute to the owner, never to volunteers); only a human can switch it to `live` from the dashboard. `effective_mode` is what actually happens at send time.",
